1
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:40,100
It hurts, doesn't it?

2
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,450
You'll feel better tomorrow, Betty, believe me.

3
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:47,210
Only one day, and it won't hurt as much.

4
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,210
Do you feel like eating?

5
00:00:48,210 --> 00:00:50,750
Having some dinner?

6
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:53,750
Oh, don't look so sad.

7
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:55,510
Let me tell you about your dinner.

8
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:57,220
It's ice cream.

9
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:58,530
Ice cream.

10
00:00:58,530 --> 00:01:00,510
All kinds of flavors.

11
00:01:00,510 --> 00:01:03,200
Chocolate.

12
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,870
Strawberry?

13
00:01:04,870 --> 00:01:06,000
Vanilla?

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,070
Vanilla, too?

15
00:01:08,070 --> 00:01:09,920
I see you're feeling better already, Betty.

16
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:12,180
So you will have dinner?

17
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:14,300
OK, honey, we'll see to it

18
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:18,500
that you have strawberry and vanilla ice cream.

19
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:19,620
Just rest now.

20
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:27,640
You need some rest to help you get better quickly.

21
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:30,970
Hi, Frank.

22
00:01:30,970 --> 00:01:34,670
How you doing?

23
00:01:34,670 --> 00:01:35,670
Oh, come on now.

24
00:01:35,670 --> 00:01:36,820
You're a big boy.

25
00:01:36,820 --> 00:01:40,620
It doesn't hurt that much, does it?

26
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:43,230
Oh, I'm sorry it hurts so much,

27
00:01:43,230 --> 00:01:44,900
and you won't be able to have dinner.

28
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:48,730
You're just going to have to have ice cream.

29
00:01:48,730 --> 00:01:51,230
Yes, ice cream.

30
00:01:51,230 --> 00:01:52,650
Lots of flavors.

31
00:01:52,650 --> 00:01:54,300
Want to hear them?

32
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:56,450
Chocolate?

33
00:01:56,450 --> 00:01:57,940
Then chocolate it is.

34
00:01:57,940 --> 00:01:59,400
One scoop or two?

35
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,620
Three scoops?

36
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:11,300
Then three it will be.

37
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:13,250
You want three scoops also?

38
00:02:13,250 --> 00:02:15,970
Chocolate, too?

39
00:02:15,970 --> 00:02:18,690
Well, I see you're feeling better.

40
00:02:18,690 --> 00:02:22,750
Well, at least you're acting like you feel better.

41
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:33,010
Three scoops of chocolate ice cream for Tim coming up.

42
00:02:33,010 --> 00:02:35,400
Hi, Carl.

43
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:39,250
How you doing?

44
00:02:39,250 --> 00:02:41,390
I know it hurts.

45
00:02:41,390 --> 00:02:43,640
But it'll be better tomorrow.

46
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,880
In the meantime, what would you like?

47
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:48,350
Surprise.

48
00:02:48,350 --> 00:02:50,890
A surprise?

49
00:02:50,890 --> 00:02:53,190
I promised you a surprise, didn't I?

50
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:57,170
And it wasn't just ice cream, was it?

51
00:02:57,170 --> 00:03:00,200
Your birthday is tomorrow, isn't it?

52
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:02,800
Well, maybe, just maybe,

53
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,610
there will be a surprise.

54
00:03:04,610 --> 00:03:07,930
But first you have to smile.

55
00:03:07,930 --> 00:03:13,650
I just want to see one smile from you.

56
00:03:13,650 --> 00:03:18,240
No smile, no surprise.

57
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,850
That's the deal.

58
00:03:19,850 --> 00:03:21,730
No smile, no surprise.

59
00:03:21,730 --> 00:03:23,170
If you want a surprise,

60
00:03:23,170 --> 00:03:44,520
then you've got to smile first.

61
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:47,130
How you all doing ?

62
00:03:47,130 --> 00:03:48,660
Well, I'm glad you're feeling better

63
00:03:48,660 --> 00:03:50,930
because we have a little surprise for you today.

64
00:03:50,930 --> 00:03:52,500
It's Carl's birthday,

65
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:56,060
and we have Popo the Clown to entertain you.

66
00:03:56,060 --> 00:05:24,830
And here he is--Popo the Clown.

67
00:05:24,830 --> 00:05:26,440
Happy birthday, Carl.

68
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:28,130
Happy birthday.

69
00:05:28,130 --> 00:05:29,310
All right, everybody.

70
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:30,200
OK, Carl.

71
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,820
It's your birthday.

72
00:05:31,820 --> 00:05:32,990
What 's your wish?

73
00:05:32,990 --> 00:05:34,520
What would you like?

74
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:36,890
Hmm?

75
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:39,890
You want to play charades?
